ome town of Bridgend to get married. When they got in touch with our wedding planning team, the brief\u00a0 was &#8220;I don&#8217;t want a traditional white wedding&#8221;. So we made sure it wasn&#8217;t!<\/p>\n<p>Each photograph is by kind permission of The Bride &amp; Groom and courtesy of the very talented Owen Mathias Photography.<\/p>\n<p>Enjoy! G.x.<\/p>\n<p><strong>&#8220;I don\u2019t know how I could ever thank Gail enough. Thank you doesn\u2019t even cover it&#8221;.<br \/>\n<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>&#8220;If you want the most magically memorable day for your daughter\u2019s wedding, Gail is the one to manage it to perfection&#8221;.<br \/>\n<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>If you would like help with any aspect of wedding planning and design or on the day support please contact Gail at gail@eleanorgail.co.uk or simply call on 0787 655 1592.<\/p>\n<\/div><div class=\"awb-gallery-wrapper awb-gallery-wrapper-1 button-span-no\"><div style=\"margin:-5px;--awb-bordersize:0px;\" class=\"fusion-gallery fusion-gallery-container fusion-grid-3 fusion-columns-total-35 fusion-gallery-layout-grid fusion-gallery-1\"><div style=\"padding:5px;\" class=\"fusion-grid-column fusion-gallery-column fusion-gallery-column-3 hover-type-none\"><div class=\"fusion-gallery-image\"><a href=\"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/09\/Owen-Mathias-Photography-Loyette-Matt-Colourful-Wedding-1.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\" data-rel=\"iLightbox[gallery_image_1]\" class=\"fusion-lightbox\" target=\"_self\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/09\/Owen-Mathias-Photography-Loyette-Matt-Colourful-Wedding-1.jpg\" width=\"999\" height=\"665\" alt=\"\" title=\"Owen Mathias Photography\" aria-label=\"Owen Mathias Photography\" class=\"img-responsive wp-image-656\" srcset=\"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/09\/Owen-Mathias-Photography-Loyette-Matt-Colourful-Wedding-1-200x133.jpg 200w, https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-conten